  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Along a Sapporo riverbank, Toshi and Toru Muranishi spot a cheerful older stranger named Ikezawa. After musing aloud that people naturally crave whatever stays hidden, Ikezawa walks straight up to Muranishi and invites him along. Listen to how Toshi's blunt street suspicions contrast with Ikezawa's easy charm and Muranishi's calm poise.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何だ、あいつ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ほらほら、もう少しだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "でもな、隠れてるからこそ見たくなるもんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "違うか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "まあ、頑張ってな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よう、あんただろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "北海道の会長の村西さんってのは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ちょっとつきあってくれないかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんた、誰？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいですよ、おつきあいしましょう。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watch how one request shifts from Ikezawa's casual invitation to Muranishi's polished reply. Let's take the key lines apart.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何だ、あいつ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who is that guy?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ほらほら、もう少しだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, just a little more.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "でもな、隠れてるからこそ見たくなるもんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, precisely because something is hidden, you want to see it, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "違うか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Am I wrong?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "まあ、頑張ってな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, keep at it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よう、あんただろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, it is you, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "北海道の会長の村西さんってのは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairman Muranishi of Hokkaido.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そうです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ちょっとつきあってくれないかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you come along with me for a bit?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんた、誰？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いいですよ、おつきあいしましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure, I will join you.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
