    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Did you catch the mirror between \"tsukiatte kurenai kana\" and \"o-tsukiai shimashou\"? The same root \"tsukiau\", keeping someone company, shifts from street-level warmth to business polish just by adding \"o\" at the front and \"shimashou\" at the end. Until next time, see you soon.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "また会いましょう。",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
